OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Creleased on bail
OL,6,FA man arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman was found dead in
OL,8,FCarlisle has been released on bail.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports that a woman in her 60s had
OL,12,Fdied suddenly at a property on
OL,13,FWhinlatter Way in the city on Sunday 2
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FCumbria Police said: "Detectives are
OL,17,Fworking to establish the full
OL,18,Fcircumstances surrounding the woman's
OL,19,Fdeath.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/2
