OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1786128506
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Creleased on bail
OL,6,F"Officers will remain in the area over
OL,7,Fthe coming days as part of those
OL,8,Fenquiries and members of the public
OL,9,Fmay continue to see an increased
OL,10,Fpolice presence.
OL,12,F"We would also ask that people refrain
OL,13,Ffrom speculation whilst the
OL,14,Finvestigation is ongoing."
